{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Game About Automation</strong> is a casual factory-building and incremental game in which your goal is to generate increasingly larger numbers until you master exponential growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/2fa95049c92fa49bfaa8ae8da0c99c24.poster.avif?t=1760029004\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/2fa95049c92fa49bfaa8ae8da0c99c24.webm?t=1760029004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/2fa95049c92fa49bfaa8ae8da0c99c24.mp4?t=1760029004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect mathematical operations, create logical chains, and discover the most efficient distribution to maximize your production. As you progress, you can improve your structures and unlock new operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and connect number generators with mathematical operations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and upgrade them by spending the points earned through numbers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best combinations to generate huge numbers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your number production chain.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926510?t=1760029004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926510?t=17600290